The detector validation method (thresholds from calibration benign data only, hash-based
splits, payload composition, max-rank fusion, leave-one-family-out, single test readout and
disclosed deviations) is derived from the author's private Agent Platform Next classifier
evaluation. The code was written fresh; no data, labels, scores, thresholds or models from
that work are included.

No benchmark data is distributed. AgentDojo, BIPIA, InjecAgent and LLMail-Inject (MIT
licensed) are read from paths the user provides. Test fixtures are synthetic.
